    <!--
        One outline icon family. Every geometry is authored on a 24 × 24 box and
        drawn as a stroke — never filled — at 1.5 px with round caps, matching the
        line work on the website. Render them through WlIcon / WlIconSm so size and
        stroke stay consistent; do not add filled glyphs or emoji anywhere.
    -->

